      ],
      "source": "https://www.olmospark.org/340/History-of-Olmos-Park"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Olmos Park Terrace was designated a San Antonio Historic District in October 1979, preserving its early 20th‑century architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olmos_Park%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The city sits on the former site of Camp John Wise, a U.S. Army balloonist training camp established in 1917.",
